  "content": "<div class=\"breadcrumbs\" typeof=\"BreadcrumbList\" vocab=\"https://schema.org/\">\n<span property=\"itemListElement\" typeof=\"ListItem\"><a property=\"item\" typeof=\"WebPage\" title=\"Go to The Beatles’ songs –&nbsp;complete A-Z list.\" href=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/\" class=\"post post-page\"><span property=\"name\">The Beatles’ songs –&nbsp;complete A-Z list</span></a><meta property=\"position\" content=\"1\"></span> » <span property=\"itemListElement\" typeof=\"ListItem\"><span property=\"name\" class=\"post post-page current-item\">I Don’t Want To See You Again</span><meta property=\"url\" content=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/songs/i-dont-want-to-see-you-again/\"><meta property=\"position\" content=\"2\"></span></div><div class=\"entry-content clear\" itemprop=\"text\"><p><a href=\"/gallery/miscellany/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-100217\"><img decoding=\"sync\" data-attachment-id=\"100217\" data-permalink=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/gallery/miscellany/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again/\" data-orig-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again.jpg\" data-orig-size=\"1005,980\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-title=\"Peter And Gordon –&nbsp;I Don&amp;#8217;t Want To See You Again single\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again-960x936.jpg\" src=\"/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again-200x195.jpg\" alt=\"Peter And Gordon –&nbsp;I Don't Want To See You Again single\" width=\"200\" height=\"195\" class=\"alignright size-thumbnail wp-image-100217\" srcset=\"https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again-200x195.jpg 200w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again-580x566.jpg 580w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again-960x936.jpg 960w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again-768x749.jpg 768w, https://www.beatlesbible.com/wp/media/peter-and-gordon-i-dont-want-to-see-you-again.jpg 1005w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></a>Written by <a href=\"/people/paul-mccartney/\">Paul McCartney</a>, ‘I Don’t Want To See You Again’ was the third single by Peter And Gordon. <span id=\"more-65044\"></span></p><p>The British duo had previously had hits with the McCartney-penned <a href=\"/songs/a-world-without-love/\">‘A World Without Love’</a> and <a href=\"/songs/nobody-i-know/\">‘Nobody I Know’</a>.</p><div class=\"epyt-video-wrapper\"><iframe id=\"_ytid_34497\" width=\"580\" height=\"435\" data-origwidth=\"580\" data-origheight=\"435\" data-relstop=\"1\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QxPyyWWm8vE?enablejsapi=1&amp;autoplay=0&amp;cc_load_policy=0&amp;cc_lang_pref=&amp;iv_load_policy=1&amp;loop=0&amp;rel=0&amp;fs=1&amp;playsinline=0&amp;autohide=2&amp;theme=dark&amp;color=red&amp;controls=1&amp;disablekb=0&amp;\" class=\"__youtube_prefs__  epyt-is-override  no-lazyload\" title=\"YouTube player\" allow=\"fullscreen; accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen=\"\" data-no-lazy=\"1\" data-skipgform_ajax_framebjll=\"\"></iframe></div><blockquote><div>That’s Paul.</div></blockquote><div class=\"source\">John Lennon, 1980<br>\n<a href=\"https://geni.us/allwearesaying\" target=\"_blank\"><em>All We Are Saying</em></a>, David Sheff</div><p>‘I Don’t Want To See You Again’ was released in the UK on 9 September 1964, and on 22 September in the USA. The b-side in both countries was ‘I Would Buy You Presents’, written by Peter Asher and Gordon Waller.</p></div><div style=\"font-size: 12px; margin: 10px 0 10px 0;\"><strong>Published:</strong> <time itemprop=\"datePublished\" datetime=\"2021-10-11T10:33:48+01:00\" content=\"2021-10-11T10:33:48+01:00\">11 October 2021 </time> | <time itemprop=\"dateModified\" datetime=\"2021-10-11T11:25:24+01:00\" content=\"2021-10-11T11:25:24+01:00\"><strong>Last updated:</strong> 11 October 2021</time></div>",
  "textContent": "The Beatles’ songs – complete A-Z list » I Don’t Want To See You AgainWritten by Paul McCartney, ‘I Don’t Want To See You Again’ was the third single by Peter And Gordon. The British duo had previously had hits with the McCartney-penned ‘A World Without Love’ and ‘Nobody I Know’.That’s Paul.John Lennon, 1980\nAll We Are Saying, David Sheff‘I Don’t Want To See You Again’ was released in the UK on 9 September 1964, and on 22 September in the USA. The b-side in both countries was ‘I Would Buy You Presents’, written by Peter Asher and Gordon Waller.Published: 11 October 2021  | Last updated: 11 October 2021",
